<title>USA: Merchants Bancorp agrees to sell unit.</title>
<headline>Merchants Bancorp agrees to sell unit.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Ill. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchants Bancorp Inc said it agreed to sell State Bank of Osco in Osco, Ill., to Central Trust and Savings Bank of Geneseo, Ill.</p>
<p>Terms of the cash purchase were not disclosed. The acquisition is subject to regulatory approval.</p>
<p>At June 30, State Bank of Osco had total assets of about $37 million.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
